"group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}], "template_override": 1}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le06ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le06ob11re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le06ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: And here we are back to your offices. Did Ms. Moore mention you would be sharing space with a few co-workers?<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi:</span> Yes, she did.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Great. You mustn't be concerned by that. We want to promote a collaborative work environment. You ought to meet them as soon as possible. I'll have your co-workers introduced to you tomorrow.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Oh, that's no problem at all.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le06ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: How are your organizational skills?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Hmmm ...  I'm not really sure.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: You'll need to devote some time to establishing general organization techniques that work for you, such as how to arrange your files and who to contact for specific information. You should include some flexibility in your system.<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I understand.", "id": 2, "time": "22100", "image": "engenn10le06ob11re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Next, you will need to adopt planning strategies. As editorial assistants, planning is particularly important, especially in relation to project management.  Projects get divided into many different tasks. Sometimes, each task has got to be completed before the next one can begin. You must plan your tasks ahead of time to bring the project to fruition. You mustn't lose track of any part of the project. It really helps to be detail-oriented. I'll have Ms. Moore talk to you more about that.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Ok.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: You should try to make good use of scheduling. Scheduling involves allocating a time period for specific tasks or workload, and then assigning tasks. As we've mentioned before, this is a deadline-based industry. In order to respect due dates, effective time management techniques have to be used.", "id": 3, "time": "43200", "image": "engenn10le06ob11re2img07.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}